<title>USA: Texas/w Okla fed cattle market roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla fed cattle market roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was slow in the panhandle area Friday. Slaughter steers and heifers steady in a light test. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers. - USDA</p>
<p>Sales reported on 800 steers and 300 heifers; following a weekly movement of 71,400 head.</p>
<p>Steers - Select and Choice 2-3, 1150-1250 lbs 66.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - Select and Choice 2-3, 1050-1150 lbs 66.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed: 1,100	  Week Ago: 7,600	 Year Ago:  400</p>
